WEBVTT

00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:03.430
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:06.390
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:11.320
I never expected that of Ichigo, though.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:14.950
Her saying that she's going to leave Starlight Academy.

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:18.170
Wait, Aoi...

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.750
Did she not tell you?

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:23.210
Here you are.

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:30.960
Sorry you had to hear it from me. {was this a recap line?}

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:11.310
<i>Ichigo is going to leave Starlight Academy?</i>

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:13.690
<i>Why?</i>

00:02:14.870 --> 00:02:15.940
Aoi...

00:02:16.960 --> 00:02:20.150
Six, five, four...

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:20.140
Not now.

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:24.150
Three, two, one, zero!

00:02:24.150 --> 00:02:25.900
Ten minutes on the dot!

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:28.080
You didn't need to <i>actually</i> wait ten minutes.

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:30.900
Ichigo, Ran!

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:33.290
Over here!

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:37.720
It's our gift to congratulate you.

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:41.490
It was a real pain getting her to wait ten minutes.

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:43.640
She kept wanting to sneak a peek in here.

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.720
It looks so good!

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:47.690
Come on and take a seat.

00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:48.500
Sure.

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:55.110
Anyway, congratulations on making it to the finals of the Starlight Queen Cup!

00:02:55.970 --> 00:02:57.110
"Anyway"?

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:58.380
Thanks!

00:02:58.380 --> 00:02:59.760
Feel free to dig in.

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:02.570
Then don't mind if I do—

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:05.990
But before that, open up wide.

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:08.000
But this is your favorite strawberry parfait.

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:10.330
It's my way of thanking you for everything.

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:15.490
Then I'll take you up on that offer.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:19.340
Sweet! But I guess that's exactly what you like.

00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:21.260
You too, Ran.

00:03:23.950 --> 00:03:25.190
So sweet!

00:03:25.190 --> 00:03:26.510
I know you'll love it.

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:29.300
We'll see about that.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:31.020
Wow, it's delicious!

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.150
Isn't it?

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:33.650
Ichigo-tan!

00:03:33.650 --> 00:03:35.730
Congratulations!

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:36.820
A parfait!

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:37.780
Same as us.

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:40.030
Another parfait!

00:03:40.030 --> 00:03:41.720
Yurika-sama had the same idea.

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:44.330
Th-This one is for myself...

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:46.700
Though I wouldn't not mind not sharing some with you... {you had the wrong number of "not"s}

00:03:47.050 --> 00:03:49.700
Yes! I've got something completely different.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.470
Whatever could this be?

00:03:53.470 --> 00:03:55.460
That's giant squid sushi! {nigiri...}

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:57.210
You didn't catch it yourself, right?

00:03:57.580 --> 00:03:59.260
Will this even fit in our mouths?

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:01.340
I can chomp through anything with these fangs!

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:03.500
Aoi?

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:06.240
Ichigo...

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:10.230
I thought Aoi already knew when I talked to her about it.

00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:11.140
Sorry.

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:14.730
Aoi, I'll tell you everything.

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:20.070
Hey girls, could you listen to me for a bit?

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:21.860
Not a problem!

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:23.640
What are you getting all serious for?

00:04:23.640 --> 00:04:26.410
If you say you want another parfait, I'll suck your blood.

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:29.700
The truth is...

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:32.410
I'm going to leave Starlight Academy.

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:35.570
W-Wait, but why?

00:04:35.570 --> 00:04:36.290
Ichigo...

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:44.260
Otome-sama...

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:47.760
I'm sure this isn't something to cry about. {I don't like this, but I can't think of a way to make it better}

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:50.810
I mean...

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:53.710
Doesn't it...

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:55.770
Yeah, doesn't this make you excited?

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:58.380
Ichigo's done something unpredictable again.

00:04:58.380 --> 00:05:02.320
She's really surprised us again, right?

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:06.610
Aoi-tan.

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:08.460
Please wipe your tears.

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:09.830
Thanks.

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:11.990
You're right, Aoi-tan.

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:15.960
Sorry about that. Could you tell us more?

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:20.590
Thanks. I'm going to quit Starlight Academy and go to America.

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:21.670
America?

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:23.760
Aoi, it's the same for me.

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:26.470
I get so excited watching everyone's Aikatsu.

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:29.110
Congrats on your movie role, Aoi.

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:33.470
Ran is aiming to be the representative muse of Spicy Ageha.

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:36.230
Yurika-chan has her S.P.Q.Rock Fest.

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:38.490
Otome-chan goes on all those talk shows—

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:40.730
Sakura-chan's getting her share of those too.

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:41.230
I am.

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:45.260
Kaede-chan is great at everything, whether it's singing, dancing, modeling, or magic.

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:46.110
Thank you.

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:50.410
As I watched you all create your very own Aikatsu, I had a thought—

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:55.510
I needed to find what <i>I</i> wanted to do, what I could do to become happy.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:06:01.160
I realized that I needed to become more passionate and more excited about my own Aikatsu.

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:05.020
That's when I remembered talking to Kaede-chan about her time in America.

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:09.260
In America, you train alongside an amazing coach while taking on part-time jobs,

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:12.760
and compete against thousands of other idols for a single part.

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:17.520
I did some research of my own on the internet after I heard that.

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:21.120
I think there's a ton of awesome Aikatsu to be found in America.

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:25.030
I want to Aikatsu all over the world and become a true idol.

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:26.650
When are you leaving?

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:28.740
Right after the Queen Cup ends.

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:32.910
I should've figured. You were always the type to follow your instincts right away.

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:35.410
Have you talked to Headmistress Orihime yet?

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:36.910
Yeah.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:39.890
It'll be a big loss to have Hoshimiya leave us.

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:41.020
That it will be.

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:43.290
But that didn't change my response.

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:44.920
I told her to go out there and get 'em. {I don't know about this one}

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:47.260
I knew it.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:49.830
Thanks for hearing me out, everyone.

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:51.960
And thank <i>you</i> for telling us.

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:54.030
Ichigo-sama, I'll support you all the way!

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:56.280
If you ever need help then just say the word.

00:06:56.280 --> 00:06:57.560
S-Same here.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:03.770
You really did surprise me.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:07.490
But that's my Ichigo! I'll support you through and through!

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:08.820
I'm your number one fan.

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:11.790
Thank you, Aoi!

00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:14.080
America, huh.

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:18.750
Aoi-neesan would classify that under <i>odayaka ja nai</i>, I believe. {fuck everything} {I'm fine with whatever you choose}

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:20.710
Aoi said she'd support me all the way.

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:22.840
I won't bother you with all the details.

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:24.460
I believe in you, Ichigo.

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:28.670
I'm not so sure, don't you think she'll stuff her face with high-calorie food?

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:29.930
That's totally possible!

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:34.350
I knew you'd let her go.

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:36.960
As her mother, I can't help but worry,

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:41.890
but as a former idol, I think that she can reach even greater heights.

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:42.840
I agree.

00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:43.810
What about you?

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:48.610
Won't you run into trouble with Soleil stopping their activities so suddenly?

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:50.700
There are actually surprisingly few problems.

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:53.890
It looks like Ichigo-chan tied up all her loose ends.

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:57.340
All of her friends are there to support her.

00:07:57.340 --> 00:07:59.870
She makes people want to encourage her,

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:01.190
myself included.

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:06.540
Good.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:07.490
Thanks.

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:12.030
The curtain is about to rise on the final day of the Starlight Queen Cup.

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:14.850
This year's Starlight Queen is about to be crowned!

00:08:14.850 --> 00:08:15.790
Get pumped up!

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:17.890
No matter who wins, I'll suck their blood!

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:22.390
Hoshimiya-san has announced that she will be flying to America after the concert.

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:26.390
I just got really nervous all of a sudden. {I like the thought of "the sudden" though}

00:08:26.390 --> 00:08:27.670
That's pretty rare.

00:08:27.670 --> 00:08:30.440
Why the cold feet? I know you'll be fine!

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:32.360
You can do it.

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:34.410
Thanks!

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:42.200
Mizuki-san.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:43.910
It's finally come to this.

00:08:44.230 --> 00:08:45.930
It's all thanks to you.

00:08:45.930 --> 00:08:51.110
You've always been just a few steps ahead of me, shining like the moon,

00:08:51.850 --> 00:08:53.170
lighting my path!

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:57.430
And it's thanks to your presence always biting on to my back

00:08:57.430 --> 00:08:59.310
that I've been pushed further forward.

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:03.250
I'm using my Love Queen Premium cards today.

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:04.810
The Royal Moon coord.

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:07.310
And I'm using my Star Festival coord.

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:09.320
Let's light up the stage.

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:12.320
Ichigo, I'm so glad I met you.

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:13.800
Me too!

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:33.690
Hoshimiya's really caught up to her.

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:39.650
The final approval ratings are in.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:43.940
Will this year's top idol be Kanzaki Mizuki for the third year in a row,

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:46.160
or will it be the challenger, Hoshimiya Ichigo?

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:49.660
Here are the results!

00:12:58.200 --> 00:12:59.320
Who will it be?!

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:12.670
This year's Starlight Queen is...

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:21.070
Decided! Kanzaki Mizuki!

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:25.440
Kanzaki Mizuki has taken the title of Starlight Queen once again!

00:13:25.440 --> 00:13:26.780
Ichigo did really well.

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:27.570
Yeah!

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:36.080
Kanzaki Mizuki-san, a few words, please.

00:13:36.470 --> 00:13:40.450
Everyone who's supported me all this time, thank you.

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:42.920
I feel that by receiving the title of Queen once again,

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:47.710
my daily efforts have been rewarded.

00:13:47.710 --> 00:13:50.690
And I was only able to shine this brightly

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:52.350
because of all my fans' support,

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:54.350
and because of Hoshimiya Ichigo!

00:13:57.020 --> 00:13:58.350
Thank you so much!

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:02.860
You have such a wonderful smile for someone who just barely fell short of victory.

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:04.640
Oh, thanks!

00:14:04.640 --> 00:14:06.030
Why is that?

00:14:06.560 --> 00:14:08.470
I may be frustrated that I lost,

00:14:08.470 --> 00:14:12.160
but I'm still unbelievably happy right now.

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:16.120
I've been supported by so many people that I'm overflowing with motivation.

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:21.010
No matter what it is, whether one takes it negatively or positively is up to oneself.

00:14:21.010 --> 00:14:23.130
Those who choose correctly grow the most.

00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:26.710
I knew Onee-chan would say that!

00:14:26.710 --> 00:14:29.000
It seems like you really understand idols now.

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:30.890
I know you'll make an excellent reporter.

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:32.390
That's a beautiful way to lose. {...}

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:34.100
Just like Hoshimiya.

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:41.270
The Mastery of Friendship... {how the fuck, by the way}

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:46.280
Coming up is Kanzaki Mizuki-san's congratulatory Special Stage.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:50.780
At the same time, Hoshimiya Ichigo-san will depart on her journey to America.

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:54.240
Thank you all so much!

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:56.530
Wait, Ichigo!

00:14:56.530 --> 00:15:00.380
I'm giving this Special Stage to you.

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:03.030
A gift to start you on your new journey.

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:05.550
But I'll miss my flight...

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:07.600
You'll make it happen somehow.

00:15:07.600 --> 00:15:12.210
Show me how far your possibilities reach with one last amazing concert.

00:15:12.210 --> 00:15:13.180
In that case...

00:15:15.150 --> 00:15:16.730
Ichigo!

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:18.890
Mizuki-san said that we could all go on!

00:15:20.280 --> 00:15:21.940
I think I'm gonna cry.

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:25.520
We made so many memories.

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:28.190
Unforgettable events and uneventful days...

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:29.700
Every single one is special.

00:15:30.270 --> 00:15:32.530
It's not just the memories we have now.

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:35.940
Plenty more memories lie in the future.

00:15:35.940 --> 00:15:38.450
One day, let's go search for them again!

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:39.460
Yeah.

00:15:39.460 --> 00:15:40.410
Right.

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:41.960
It's a promise.

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:44.230
Ai-katsu!

00:20:05.130 --> 00:20:07.920
You don't have to hold it in anymore.

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:11.460
I'm happy for her!

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:13.660
I'm Ichigo's number one fan!

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:18.260
I can't wait for Ichigo to turn into an even better idol!

00:20:18.260 --> 00:20:21.460
I swear I'll always, always be cheering you on!

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:23.660
Aoi, I love you!

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:28.680
Aren't you holding it in, too?

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:30.910
Wh-What's that mean?

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:33.520
You came even though you're so busy.

00:20:33.520 --> 00:20:35.360
There's no way we <i>wouldn't</i> come!

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:35.920
That's right.

00:20:36.390 --> 00:20:38.530
We met through Aikatsu.

00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:40.230
We may all be idols,

00:20:40.230 --> 00:20:41.210
but we're also friends.

00:20:41.370 --> 00:20:44.720
You're our precious, irreplaceable, once-in-a-lifetime friend!

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:46.930
Really, thank you.

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:49.880
Besides, this is just like changing seats or changing classes.

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:52.230
No matter how close you are, 
you have to say goodbye eventually!

00:20:52.420 --> 00:20:55.210
Yeah, and our feelings will always connect us.

00:20:55.210 --> 00:20:58.110
Really, thank you so much.

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:01.960
You're all my beloved idols,

00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:03.850
and my beloved friends.

00:21:08.470 --> 00:21:09.450
I'm going now.

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:10.270
Yeah.

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:14.000
And here, open this when you're really in a pinch.

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:16.000
Got it. Thanks!

00:21:16.950 --> 00:21:18.460
I've got something for you too.

00:21:19.030 --> 00:21:20.510
A parachute!

00:21:21.070 --> 00:21:23.760
A strong impact is the most important part of landing.

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:25.510
Thanks!

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:27.260
I'm a bit nervous now.

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:32.640
Will all passengers on Flight 1010 to New York please proceed...

00:21:30.440 --> 00:21:32.640
I've gotta get going! See you!

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:33.970
We'll be here for you!

00:21:33.970 --> 00:21:37.890
If you come back without accomplishing anything, I'll suck your blood!

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:49.080
Ichigo never changes.

00:21:49.080 --> 00:21:51.530
Yeah. I'm sure that Ichigo

00:21:51.530 --> 00:21:53.720
will become an even more amazing idol.

00:21:54.900 --> 00:21:59.710
As I'm sure you're all aware, 
Hoshimiya Ichigo has gone overseas.

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:03.210
However, there is one more student who has left this academy.

00:22:03.210 --> 00:22:03.940
Huh?

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:04.710
Who?

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:06.710
The idol who has left us...

00:22:07.790 --> 00:22:09.220
is Kanzaki Mizuki.

00:22:12.520 --> 00:22:13.720
Why?

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:16.850
Kanzaki has chosen to walk her own path—

00:22:16.850 --> 00:22:20.690
Not that of Starlight Academy's, nor that of mine.

00:23:55.690 --> 00:23:57.790
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.990 --> 00:24:01.770
It's already been a year since we transferred in.

00:24:01.770 --> 00:24:04.470
A year sure goes by quickly when you're an idol.

00:24:04.470 --> 00:24:06.790
Yep, it was like a roller coaster ride the whole way through.

00:24:08.310 --> 00:24:09.920
Being an idol is fun!

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:13.390
After Ichigo left, the idol world was flipped upside down!

00:24:13.390 --> 00:24:16.330
Promising new idols from a new school are debuting.

00:24:16.330 --> 00:24:18.050
Starlight's in a huge pinch!

00:24:18.050 --> 00:24:19.440
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:19.440 --> 00:24:21.430
That rocker is a dream girl.

00:24:21.430 --> 00:24:25.770
With ever burning passion, Idol Activities!
